## Racebin configuration
## Runtime and infrastructure settings only. Site behavior is managed in the owner UI.

## Listener
RACEBIN_BIND=127.0.0.1
# RACEBIN_PORT=7042
# RACEBIN_THREADS=2

## Storage and public URL
RACEBIN_DATA_DIR=/var/lib/racebin
# RACEBIN_PUBLIC_URL=https://paste.example.com
# Comma-separated immediate proxy addresses whose X-Forwarded-For value is trusted.
# RACEBIN_TRUSTED_PROXIES=127.0.0.1,::1

## Operational limits and transport security
# RACEBIN_MAX_ATTACHMENT_SIZE_MB=2048
# RACEBIN_INSECURE_COOKIE=false

## Site name, homepage mode, public exploration, invitations, attachments, QR codes,
## and paste defaults are managed in the Racebin administration UI.

## Accounts are managed with:
## racebin account create USERNAME [--admin] --data-dir /var/lib/racebin
## racebin account owner USERNAME --data-dir /var/lib/racebin
## racebin account password USERNAME --data-dir /var/lib/racebin
